{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"理查德·汉明·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"richard-hamming","categoryLabel":"理查德·汉明","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/06_richard-hamming/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"代表成就\">代表成就</h1><p>本卷盘点理查德·汉明留给世界的三类代表性&quot;作品&quot;——一项<strong>改变信息文明的发明</strong>（汉明码）、一批<strong>塑造计算思维的著作</strong>（以《科学家与工程师的数值方法》为首），以及一组<strong>确认其历史地位的最高荣誉</strong>（1968 年图灵奖及以他命名的 IEEE 汉明奖章）。三者分别对应&quot;做出了什么、写下了什么、被如何铭记&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷的分工\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷的分工</h2><p>本人物（理查德·汉明）共有六卷，各有侧重，请勿混淆：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁、活在何种时代</td>\n<td>本卷不重复生平叙事</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>贡献的<strong>技术内核</strong>（码字推导、汉明距离、数值算法细节）</td>\n<td>本卷讲&quot;成就的地位与影响&quot;，技术细节交给第 2 卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他如何做研究（《你和你的研究》）</td>\n<td>本卷只在&quot;著作&quot;中提及该演讲，深读去第 3 卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4 代表成就（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>哪些作品/荣誉代表了他</strong></td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他对后世的长远影响</td>\n<td>本卷讲&quot;成就本身&quot;，宏观涟漪交给第 5 卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>对他的批评与多元评价</td>\n<td>本卷只点到为止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>一句话区分</strong>：第 2 卷拆解&quot;汉明码<strong>怎么算</strong>&quot;，本卷讲&quot;汉明码<strong>为何是里程碑、用在哪、获了什么奖</strong>&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷结构\">本卷结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;代表成就&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;1 汉明码的成就&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;2 著作&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;3 图灵奖&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;纠错码的革命&lt;br/&gt;起源·数学·历史地位&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;广泛的应用&lt;br/&gt;内存·通信·存储·深空&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;《科学家与工程师的数值方法》&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;其他著作&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;图灵奖的荣誉&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;学界的认可&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"代表成就\"] --&gt; B[\"1 汉明码的成就\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"2 著作\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"3 图灵奖\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"纠错码的革命&lt;br/&gt;起源·数学·历史地位\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"广泛的应用&lt;br/&gt;内存·通信·存储·深空\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"《科学家与工程师的数值方法》\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"其他著作\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"图灵奖的荣誉\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"学界的认可\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>篇</th>\n<th>一句话</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 汉明码的成就</td>\n<td><a href=\"hamming-codes-legacy/the-error-correcting-revolution\">纠错码的革命</a></td>\n<td>1950 年论文如何开创编码理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 汉明码的成就</td>\n<td><a href=\"hamming-codes-legacy/applications\">广泛的应用</a></td>\n<td>从 ECC 内存到旅行者号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 著作</td>\n<td><a href=\"books-and-writings/numerical-methods-book\">数值方法书</a></td>\n<td>&quot;计算的目的在于洞察&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 著作</td>\n<td><a href=\"books-and-writings/other-writings\">其他著作</a></td>\n<td>9 部著作的完整谱系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 图灵奖</td>\n<td><a href=\"turing-award/the-turing-award\">图灵奖的荣誉</a></td>\n<td>1968 年三合一表彰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 图灵奖</td>\n<td><a href=\"turing-award/recognition\">学界的认可</a></td>\n<td>荣誉谱系与双向最高荣誉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a> 了解技术内核，再读本卷把握其&quot;地位&quot;层面，理解会更立体。无技术背景者可直接从本卷入手。</li>\n<li><strong>快速路线</strong>（30 分钟）：<a href=\"hamming-codes-legacy/the-error-correcting-revolution\">纠错码的革命</a> → <a href=\"turing-award/the-turing-award\">图灵奖的荣誉</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>完整路线</strong>：按 1 → 2 → 3 章顺序通读，最后跳到 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a> 看长远涟漪。</li>\n<li><strong>思想路线</strong>：读完 <a href=\"books-and-writings/numerical-methods-book\">数值方法书</a> 与 <a href=\"books-and-writings/other-writings\">其他著作</a> 后，转入 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a> 深读《你和你的研究》。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三类成就——发明、著作、荣誉——共同确立了汉明作为纠错码理论奠基人与计算科学先驱的历史地位。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hamming-codes-legacy","title":"汉明码的成就","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/hamming-codes-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-error-correcting-revolution","title":"纠错码的革命","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/hamming-codes-legacy/the-error-correcting-revolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"applications","title":"广泛的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/hamming-codes-legacy/applications"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"books-and-writings","title":"著作","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/books-and-writings","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"numerical-methods-book","title":"《科学家与工程师的数值方法》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/books-and-writings/numerical-methods-book"},{"seq":2,"slug":"other-writings","title":"其他著作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/books-and-writings/other-writings"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"turing-award","title":"图灵奖","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/turing-award","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-turing-award","title":"图灵奖的荣誉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/turing-award/the-turing-award"},{"seq":2,"slug":"recognition","title":"学界的认可","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/major-works/turing-award/recognition"}]}]}